{"id":"word:hebrew:H2833","type":"word","title":"חֹשֶׁן","subtitle":"H2833 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"perhaps a pocket (as holding the Urim and Thummim), or rich (as containing gems), used only of the gorget of the highpriest","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to חֹשֶׁן (H2833) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 25 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"חֹשֶׁן (chôshen) means perhaps a pocket (as holding the Urim and Thummim), or rich (as containing gems), used only of the gorget of the highpriest First listed occurrence: Exod 25 7."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"חֹשֶׁן","transliteration":"chôshen","pronunciation":"kho'-shen","strong":"H2833","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2833","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["הַ/חֹ֑שֶׁן","הַ/חֹ֔שֶׁן","הַ/חֹֽשֶׁן","וְ/לַ/חֹֽשֶׁן","הַ/חֹ֛שֶׁן"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncmsa",18],["HC/Rd/Ncmsa",3],["HNcmsc",2],["HNcmsa",1],["HR/Ncmsc",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"perhaps a pocket (as holding the Urim and Thummim), or rich (as containing gems), used only of the gorget of the highpriest","usage":"breastplate.","full":"H2833. choshen ח֫שֶׁן noun masculine the breast-piece or sacred pouch , containing the ותמים אורים , worn on the breast of the high priest when he ministered in the Holy Place to bring the tribes for memorial. before ׳י . It was made of the same material as the ephod (see אֵפוֺד ), a span square; set in front with twelve jewels in four rows, engraved with the names of the twelve tribes. It was firmly fastened to the shoulders of the ephod by gold chains passing through gold rings, and to the lower part of the ephod just above the girdle by a blue ribbon passing through other gold rings. It was (ה)מִשְׁמָּט חשֶׁן ( Exod 28:15 , 29 , 30 ) pouch of judgment , because of the decision given by the וְתֻמִּים אוּרִים . The name occurs only in P, 25:7 ; 28:4 , 15 , 22 , 23 (twice in verse); 28:24 , 26 , 28 (twice in verse); 28:29-30 , 29:5 ; 35:9 , 27 ; 39:8-9 , 15 , 16 , 17 , 19 , 21 (twice in verse); Lev 8:8 (twice in verse). &#8212; See Now Archaeology ii. 119 .","rootNote":"from an unused root probably meaning to contain or sparkle ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Exod 25 7","keyReferences":["Exod 25 7","Exod 28 4","Exod 28 15","Exod 28 22","Exod 28 23","Exod 28 23","Exod 28 24","Exod 28 26"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":25,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Exod 25 7","book":"Exod","chapter":25,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/לַ/חֹֽשֶׁן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Rd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 28 4","book":"Exod","chapter":28,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֹ֤שֶׁן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 28 15","book":"Exod","chapter":28,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֹ֤שֶׁן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Exod 28 22","book":"Exod","chapter":28,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֹ֛שֶׁן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 28 23","book":"Exod","chapter":28,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֹ֔שֶׁן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 28 23","book":"Exod","chapter":28,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֹֽשֶׁן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 28 24","book":"Exod","chapter":28,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֹֽשֶׁן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 28 26","book":"Exod","chapter":28,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֹ֑שֶׁן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 28 28","book":"Exod","chapter":28,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ֠/חֹשֶׁן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 28 28","book":"Exod","chapter":28,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֹ֔שֶׁן","source":"